Package: tccquickr
Title: Experimental R Code Transformation Framework on Top of 'Rtinycc'
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person(
      given = "Sounkou Mahamane",
      family = "Toure",
      email = "sounkoutoure@gmail.com",
      role = c("aut", "cre")
    )
  )
Description: Provides an experimental and intentionally narrow
    declare()-annotated R code transformation and R-to-C compilation
    framework built on top of 'Rtinycc'. The package contains frontend
    parsing, typed IR, middle-end kernel rewrites, target C emission,
    and backend-neutral compilation helpers while keeping the underlying
    TinyCC toolchain and FFI runtime in 'Rtinycc'
    <https://github.com/sounkou-bioinfo/Rtinycc>.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Depends: R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports:
    Rtinycc
Suggests:
    bench,
    tinytest,
    quickr,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown
Remotes: sounkou-bioinfo/Rtinycc
Encoding: UTF-8
